<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India BSE Index on Sept 9.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India BSE Index on Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day upto 0630 GMT and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0630 GMT) was 3487.77, 20.30 points or 0.58 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
